<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f7f4; }
        .wrapper { width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; background-color: #f4f7f4; padding: 20px 0; }
        .main { background-color: #ffffff; margin: 0 auto; width: 600px; border-spacing: 0; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4A8C3F 0%, #35632d 100%); padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; color: #ffffff; }
        .content { padding: 40px; }
        .footer { background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; color: #999999; font-size: 12px; }
        h1 { color: #4A8C3F; font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 20px 0; text-align: center; }
        .order-box { background-color: #fafafa; border-radius: 10px; padding: 25px; margin: 25px 0; border: 1px solid #eee; }
        .order-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        .order-table th { background-color: #edf5ec; padding: 12px; text-align: left; color: #4A8C3F; font-size: 14px; border-bottom: 2px solid #4A8C3F; }
        .order-table td { padding: 12px; font-size: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; color: #333; }
        .info-badge { background: #eef8ff; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 4px solid #4A8C3F; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #333; }
        .total-row td { padding-top: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4A8C3F; font-size: 18px; text-align: right; }
        .btn-container { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; }
        .btn { background-color: #4A8C3F; color: #ffffff !important; padding: 15px 35px; border-radius: 50px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <center>
            <table class="main" width="600">
                <tr>
                    <td class="header">
                        <img src="https://i.ibb.co/8nyxk57x/logo-ardhi.png" alt="Ardhi Logo" style="max-width: 160px; height: auto; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                        <p style="margin: 0; color: #e8f5e9; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.9;">Votre marketplace de confiance</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="content">
                        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            <span style="font-size: 40px;">📦</span>
                        </div>
                        <h1>Nouvelle commande reçue !</h1>
                        <p>Bonjour <strong>{{ vendeur.prenom }}</strong>,</p>
                        <p>Félicitations ! Un client, <strong>{{ commande.user.prenom }} {{ commande.user.nom }}</strong>, vient de commander vos produits. Voici le récapitulatif de la commande <strong>#{{ commande.id }}</strong> :</p>
                        
                        <div class="order-box">
                            <h3 style="margin: 0 0 15px 0; color: #4A8C3F; font-size: 18px;">🛒 Articles commandés</h3>
                            <table class="order-table">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th>Produit</th>
                                        <th style="text-align: center;">Quantité</th>
                                        <th style="text-align: right;">Total</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    {% for item in items %}
                                        <tr>
                                            <td>{{ item.produit.nom }}</td>
                                            <td style="text-align: center;">x{{ item.quantite }}</td>
                                            <td style="text-align: right;">{{ item.sousTotal|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} DT</td>
                                        </tr>
                                    {% endfor %}
                                </tbody>
                                <tfoot>
                                    {% if commande.modeLivraison == 'LIVRAISON' %}
                                        <tr>
                                            <td colspan="2" style="padding: 10px 12px 0 12px; text-align: right; color: #666; font-size: 14px;">Frais de livraison :</td>
                                            <td style="padding: 10px 12px 0 12px; text-align: right; color: #666; font-size: 14px;">+7,00 DT</td>
                                        </tr>
                                    {% endif %}
                                    <tr class="total-row">
                                        <td colspan="2">Montant total à recevoir :</td>
                                        <td>{{ commande.total|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} DT</td>
                                    </tr>
                                </tfoot>
                            </table>
                        </div>

                        <div class="info-badge">
                            <strong>🚚 Mode de livraison :</strong> {{ commande.modeLivraison }}
                        </div>

                        <p>Nous vous invitons à préparer ces articles avec soin pour garantir une livraison dans les meilleurs délais.</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="footer">
                        <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-weight: bold; color: #4A8C3F; font-size: 16px;">L'équipe Ardhi</p>
                        <p style="margin: 0 0 15px 0;">Cultivons l'avenir ensemble.</p>
                        <p style="margin: 0;">Besoin d'aide ? <a href="mailto:contact@ardhi.com" style="color: #4A8C3F; text-decoration: none;">contact@ardhi.com</a></p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </center>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
